#NEXUS

[ dallavecchia2006a_fig20: Hadrosaurid slanted cladogram, read from a 3x crop. Each dot sits on the stem just below the node it names; Hadrosauridae, Euhadrosauria, Hadrosaurinae and Lambeosaurinae are kept on those nodes. Two three-way nodes: Naashoibitosaurus, Saurolophus and '“Kritosaurus” australis'; and Corythosaurus, Hypacrosaurus and Lambeosaurus (Hypacrosaurus' short line and Lambeosaurus' line meet Corythosaurus' line at one point). 19 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 3 children); 4 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=19;
    TAXLABELS
        Iguanodon
        Probactrosaurus
        Protohadros
        Eolambia
        Telmatosaurus
        Lophorhothon
        Naashoibitosaurus
        Saurolophus
        '“Kritosaurus” australis'
        Prosaurolophus
        Gryposaurus
        Edmontosaurus
        Maiasaura
        Brachylophosaurus
        Corythosaurus
        Hypacrosaurus
        Lambeosaurus
        Parasaurolophus
        Tsintaosaurus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE dallavecchia2006a_fig20 = [&R] (Iguanodon,(Probactrosaurus,((Protohadros,Eolambia),(Telmatosaurus,((Lophorhothon,((Naashoibitosaurus,Saurolophus,'“Kritosaurus” australis'),(Prosaurolophus,(Gryposaurus,(Edmontosaurus,(Maiasaura,Brachylophosaurus))))))Hadrosaurinae,(((Corythosaurus,Hypacrosaurus,Lambeosaurus),Parasaurolophus),Tsintaosaurus)Lambeosaurinae)Euhadrosauria)Hadrosauridae)));
END;
